2_QA_QC.Rmd \
Cleaning raw urchin transect, kelp out planted plots and environmental data. Making certain variables numeric, fixing errors in data entry, create new more meaningful columns, renaming sites for alignment, removing leading/trailing zeros. For environmental data (HOBO), data was summarized based on conditions between monitoring periods. \
Creates a combined cleaned dataset for analysis and modelling\
\
Percent kelp = number gravel with kelp / number of gravel total x 100 \
\
Urchin density (for plots) - calculated per meter squared \
	For open plots - urchin density = total number urchins / 1 \
	For caged plots - urchin density = total number urchins / 4.5 \
\
\
Grazer density (for plots) - calculated per meter squared (see above), only include urchin species, turban snails and abalone\
Kelp_growth = summed growth per plot \
	\
	Inputs\
	- urchin_monitoring_transects.csv  (raw data) \
	- green_gravel_monitoring.csv (raw data) \
	- YSI_measurement.csv (raw data) \
	- combined_hobo.csv (output of previous script, processed data) \
	- monitoring_periods.csv (described dates of monitoring periods) \
	- combined_env.csv\
	- tilt_summary.csv\
\
	Outputs \
	- cleaned_green_gravel_monitoring.csv (processed data) \
	- cleaned_monitoring_transects.csv (processed_data) \
	- cleaned_ysi_measurement.csv" (processed data) \
	- summary_hobo.csv (processed data) \
	- density_urchin_transects.csv (summary of urchin densities per transect)\
	- cleaned_data.csv (combined data frame) \
	- summary_env.csv\
	- summary_tilt.csv\
\
Notes\
- A lot of missing values in YSI data (due to sensor issues, weather contingencies) \
- Will eventually need to add tilt current meter data \
\
3_Density_Analysis.Rmd\
\
This script provides the analysis for answering questions related to urchin densities. \
	(1) What are the mean sea urchin densities across treatments? \
	(2) Did urchin densities vary significantly across months? Across sites? \
	(3) Were there significant differences in urchin densities between open and caged  \
	      treatments? \
	(4) Were there significant differences in grazer densities between open and caged treatments? \
	\
\
Determines the mean depths of sites, including the shallowest and deepest site. \
Determines if urchin densities are statistically different from each other across sites. \
Determine mean urchin densities by site \
Visualizes urchin counts over transects \
\
	Inputs\
		- cleaned_monitoring_transects.csv\
		- cleaned_green_gravel_monitoring.csv\
		- density_urchin_transects.csv\
\
	Outputs\
		- densities_by_sp.png (stacked bar chart of sp by site)\
		- bw_box_densities_by_site.png\
		- densities_month_site_col.png\
		- box_densities_by_site.png (urchin densities across sites)\
		- baseline_densities.png (urchin densities by site for April) \
		- densities_by_month.png \
		- summary_transect_counts.png\
		- box_treatment.png (box plot of open v caged treatment densities, grazers and urchins)\
		- bar_treatment.png (bar plot of open v caged treatment densities, grazers and urchins)\
		- grazer counts\
\
\
\
